+++ b/doc/changelog.asciidoc
@@ -74,6 +74,12 @@ Removed
 Changed
 ~~~~~~~
 
+- Improved messages for spawned processes:
+    * Error messages now reference the PID of the failing process (rather than
+      suggesting `:process`, which shows the last spawned one).
+    * Processes terminated via SIGTERM are no longer shown as an error (unless
+      `--verbose` is used).
+    * When a process is killed by a signal, its name is now shown.
 - The qutebrowser icons got moved from `icons/` to `qutebrowser/icons` in the
   repository, so that it's possible for qutebrowser to load them using Python's
   resource system (rather than compiling them into a Qt resource file).
